#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1073 expect=violation domain=AE
#note "The OTHER TWO prohibited qualifiers, AESTAT and AEREASND, and deliberately NO AEOCCUR. Since the D-15 rewrite (2026-09-12) the membership Check is evaluated per variable, so two prohibited columns are TWO findings, each naming its culprit - the pre-rewrite dataset-level or-tree collapsed exactly this dataset to a single anonymous finding (count was 1). This scenario is the count-direction witness: the rewrite can only keep or RAISE the finding count, never lower it."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 2
#expectViolationAt variable_name=AESTAT
#expectViolationAt variable_name=AEREASND
dataset AE label="Adverse Events"
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col AESEQ    type=Num
col AETERM   type=Char
col AESTAT   type=Char
col AEREASND type=Char
---
S1 | AE | 001 | 1 | HEADACHE | NOT DONE | Subject refused
